            "id": 146705,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sottrai 50 dal valore della variabile.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"--\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"231\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"coins -= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146706,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>Level up, Silvia</code> nella console aggiungendo <code>\" Silvia\"</code> al valore della variabile <code>message</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"--\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level up,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message += \" /><text value=\"&quot; Silvia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>message</code>, seguito da <code>+=</code> e poi <code>\" Silvia\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146707,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth -= \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>7</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-7</code>.</p></body></html>"
