          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146709,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesLeft = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemiesLeft--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemiesLeft);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>29</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>31</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>28</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>29</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146710,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cos'è un ciclo infinito in un gioco?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un ciclo che esegue il suo blocco di codice continuamente, per sempre</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un ciclo che esegue il suo blocco di codice una volta</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un ciclo che salta il suo blocco di codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un ciclo che esegue il suo blocco di codice continuamente, per sempre.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146711,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come facciamo a sapere che questo ciclo eseguirà il suo codice ancora e ancora per sempre?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché la condizione rimane <code>true</code> per sempre</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché la condizione rimane <code>false</code> per sempre</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Perché la condizione passa da <code>false</code> a <code>true</code> per sempre</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché la condizione rimane <code>true</code> per sempre.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146712,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale codice esegue ripetutamente il ciclo while?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating game state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Stopping game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>console.log(\"Updating game state\");</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let isRunning = false;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>console.log(\"Stopping game\");</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>console.log(\"Updating game state\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146713,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come sappiamo che questo ciclo while salta il suo blocco di codice?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning enemies...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La condizione è <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La condizione è <code>true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo capire se salta il suo blocco di codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La condizione è <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146714,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salta il blocco di codice del ciclo while impostando la condizione su <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"40\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Start match!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Next frame:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Update and render&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Match ended!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 146715,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per eseguire il ciclo, assegna <code>true</code> a <code>isPlaying</code> al di fuori del blocco di codice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPlaying = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPlaying === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Next frame!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPlaying = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 146716,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come facciamo a sapere che questo ciclo non si ferma?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isGameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing background music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isGameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché la variabile <code>isGameRunning</code> non viene aggiornata a <code>false</code> all'interno del blocco di codice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché tutti i cicli <code>while</code> non si fermano</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Perché la variabile <code>isGameRunning</code> viene aggiornata a <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché la variabile <code>isGameRunning</code> non viene aggiornata a <code>false</code> all'interno del blocco di codice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 146717,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasMoreLoot = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasMoreLoot === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" hasMoreLoot = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loot found:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You picked up a potion!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Loot found:</code> e poi <code>You picked up a potion!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Questo codice non visualizza nulla nella console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Loot found:</code> e poi <code>You picked up a potion!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 146718,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati che questo ciclo while ripeta il suo blocco di codice mentre <code>isPaused</code> è uguale a <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game is paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>, seguito da <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
